{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"const assetPathPrefix = \"https://www.figma.com/api/mcp/asset/5760e033-f8b2-4323-85de-ae1d9c70df8d\";\nconst img = `${assetPathPrefix}/83ac5.svg`;\nconst img1 = `${assetPathPrefix}/c4e1e.svg`;\nconst img2 = `${assetPathPrefix}/a5de6.svg`;\nconst img3 = `${assetPathPrefix}/d5d93.svg`;\nconst imgGroup12 = `${assetPathPrefix}/ba4c8.svg`;\n\nfunction NavStores({ className }: { className?: string }) {\n  return (\n    <div className={className || \"bg-white h-[60px] relative w-[390px]\"} data-node-id=\"336:783\" data-name=\"САДОХОД / nav / stores\">\n      <div className=\"absolute left-[52.5px] size-[27px] top-[16.5px]\" data-node-id=\"336:784\" data-name=\"Магазины\">\n        <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={img} />\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"absolute left-[169.5px] size-[27px] top-[16.5px]\" data-node-id=\"336:789\" data-name=\"Камера\">\n        <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={img1} />\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"absolute left-[286.5px] size-[27px] top-[16.5px]\" data-node-id=\"336:792\" data-name=\"Профиль\">\n        <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={img2} />\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default function Component26() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"bg-[#f0efeb] relative size-full\" data-node-id=\"440:641\" data-name=\"26 · Поиск · Все товары · Пусто\">\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-[#f0efeb] h-[57px] left-[438.91px] top-[155px] w-[37.174px]\" data-node-id=\"440:656\" />\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[50px] not-italic text-[#a5a5a5] text-[12px] top-[469px] whitespace-nowrap\" data-node-id=\"440:659\">{` `}</p>\n      <NavStores className=\"absolute bg-white bottom-0 h-[60px] left-0 w-[390px]\" />\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] h-[60px] left-[125px] top-[895px] w-[110px]\" data-node-id=\"440:661\" data-name=\"NAV / Камера\" />\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] h-[60px] left-[242px] top-[895px] w-[110px]\" data-node-id=\"440:662\" data-name=\"NAV / Профиль\" />\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Bold'] h-[24px] leading-[normal] left-[30px] not-italic text-[16px] text-black top-[243px] w-[250px]\" data-node-id=\"440:663\">\n        результаты поиска\n      </p>\n      <a className=\"-translate-x-1/2 absolute contents cursor-pointer left-1/2 top-[68px]\" data-node-id=\"440:688\">\n        <div className=\"absolute bg-[#a5a5a5] h-[48px] left-[30px] rounded-[100px] top-[68px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"440:689\" />\n        <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[calc(50%-138px)] not-italic text-[16px] text-white top-[83px] whitespace-nowrap\" data-node-id=\"440:690\">\n          мои магазины\n        </p>\n        <div className=\"absolute flex items-center justify-center left-[331px] top-[74px]\" data-node-id=\"440:691\">\n          <div className=\"-scale-y-100 flex-none rotate-180\">\n            <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] font-['Helvetica:Bold'] leading-[normal] not-italic relative text-[30px] text-white whitespace-nowrap\">‹</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n      <a className=\"-translate-x-1/2 absolute contents cursor-pointer left-1/2 top-[129px]\" data-node-id=\"440:692\">\n        <div className=\"absolute bg-[#48352d] h-[48px] left-[30px] rounded-[100px] top-[129px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"440:693\" />\n        <div className=\"absolute contents left-[121px] top-[143px]\" data-node-id=\"440:694\">\n          <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[calc(50%-44px)] not-italic text-[16px] text-white top-[calc(50%-207px)] whitespace-nowrap\" data-node-id=\"440:695\">\n            добавить товар\n          </p>\n          <div className=\"absolute left-[121px] size-[19px] top-[144px]\" data-node-id=\"440:696\" data-name=\"Камера\">\n            <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={img3} />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] h-[60px] left-0 top-[640px] w-[130px]\" data-node-id=\"440:707\" data-name=\"FLOW / Низ / Магазин\" />\n      <a className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] block cursor-pointer h-[60px] left-[130px] top-[640px] w-[130px]\" data-node-id=\"440:708\" data-name=\"FLOW / Низ / Камера\" />\n      <a className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] block cursor-pointer h-[60px] left-[260px] top-[640px] w-[130px]\" data-node-id=\"440:709\" data-name=\"FLOW / Низ / Профиль\" />\n      <a className=\"absolute contents cursor-pointer left-[30px] top-[194px]\" data-node-id=\"440:900\" data-name=\"Поиск / Поле\">\n        <div className=\"absolute contents left-[30px] top-[194px]\" data-node-id=\"440:901\">\n          <div className=\"absolute bg-[#d9d9d9] h-[32px] left-[30px] rounded-[20px] top-[194px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"440:902\" />\n          <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[73px] not-italic text-[12px] text-white top-[203px] whitespace-nowrap\" data-node-id=\"440:903\">\n            куртка\n          </p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"absolute left-[45px] size-[20px] top-[200px]\" data-node-id=\"440:904\">\n          <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={imgGroup12} />\n        </div>\n      </a>\n      <p className=\"-translate-x-1/2 [word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[344px] not-italic text-[#1a1a1a] text-[22px] text-center top-[196px] w-[24px]\" data-node-id=\"440:913\">\n        ×\n      </p>\n      <p className=\"-translate-x-1/2 [word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Bold'] leading-[normal] left-[195px] not-italic text-[#1a1a1a] text-[18px] text-center top-[359px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"440:914\">\n        ничего не найдено\n      </p>\n      <p className=\"-translate-x-1/2 [word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[195px] not-italic text-[#a4a4a4] text-[13px] text-center top-[396px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"440:915\">\n        Попробуйте другое название.\n      </p>\n      <a className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] block cursor-pointer h-[34px] left-[324px] top-[194px] w-[37px]\" data-node-id=\"441:622\" data-name=\"PROTO / Закрыть поиск\" />\n    </div>\n  );\n}"},{"type":"text","text":"SUPER CRITICAL: The generated React+Tailwind code MUST be converted to match the target project's technology stack and styling system.\n1. Analyze the target codebase to identify: technology stack, styling approach, component patterns, and design tokens\n2. Convert React syntax to the target framework/library\n3. Transform all Tailwind classes to the target styling system while preserving exact visual design\n4. Follow the project's existing patterns and conventions\nDO NOT install any Tailwind as a dependency unless the user instructs you to do so.\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Node ids have been added to the code as data attributes, e.g. `data-node-id=\"1:2\"`."},{"type":"text","text":"These styles are contained in the design: beige: #F0EFEB, gray 2: #A5A5A5, white: #FFFFFF, brown: #48352D, gray 5: #D9D9D9."},{"type":"text","text":"The generated code contains image and SVG URL constants, e.g. const image = `${assetPathPrefix}/<asset file name>`, where assetPathPrefix is declared once at the top of the code and every asset URL interpolates it. These URLs are temporary download sources and expire after 7 days. Download each asset into the project with curl -L, then replace its URL in the generated code with a reference to the downloaded asset. Never use the temporary URLs as runtime image sources."},{"type":"image","data":"","mimeType":"image/png"}],"structuredContent":null,"isError":false}
